  id: quest.letter_deliver
  displayName: Please don't read it
  description: The seal on the letter is a little bat. Pekapeka looks very worried about it. Find something that glows, for reading it by, then hand it over.
  giver: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ff40b74e031a0544080ac511f31948ce, type: 2}
