  offerLine: Oh no. Oh, that's mine. I wrote that. I wrote it to Gus, ages ago, and I lost my nerve and dropped it. I can't read it in this dark, which is ridiculous. Could you find me a glowworm?
  activeLine: A glowworm, to read by. And then I suppose I have to give it to him. Oh dear.
  readyLine: It only says thank you. All this time. It says thank you for talking to me, when nobody did. Please don't tell him. Here. These are the nicest things I own.
  doneLine: I gave it to him. He said it's in code. It's the nicest thing anyone's ever said to me.
